    "text": "A capacitor $\\mathrm{C}_1$ is charged up to a voltage $\\mathrm{V}=$ $60 \\mathrm{~V}$ by connecting it to battery $\\mathrm{B}$ through switch (1), Now $\\mathrm{C}_1$ is disconnected from battery and connected to a circuit consisting of two uncharged capacitors $\\mathrm{C}_2=3.0 \\mu \\mathrm{F}$ and $\\mathrm{C}_3=6.0 \\mu \\mathrm{F}$ through a switch $(2)$ as shown in the figure. The sum of final charges on $\\mathrm{C}_2$ and $\\mathrm{C}_3$ is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/uoRQ6EXUInLURQn9sNtEEOnUfzLwEW53ip_eu5p6KSg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
